        "x": 1290,
        "y": 752,
        "content": "gdf = arg\n\n# Two layers: the ZIP polygons, and a point at each one's centre.\ncentres = gdf.copy()\ncentres[\"geometry\"] = gdf.to_crs(26971).centroid.to_crs(4326)\n\nreturn gdf, centres",
